## **Basic Terminology in Trees** 🌲  

| **Term (English)** | **Meaning (English)** | **Meaning (Hinglish)** |
|--------------------|----------------------|------------------------|
| **Node** | An element in the tree that contains data | Tree ka ek element jo data store karta hai |
| **Root** | The topmost node in the tree | Tree ka sabse upar wala node |
| **Parent** | A node that has child nodes | Jo kisi bhi node ka parent hai |
| **Child** | A node that comes from a parent node | Parent node se connected ek node |
| **Edge** | A connection between two nodes | Do nodes ke beech ka connection |
| **Leaf Node** | A node with no children | Jiska koi bhi child nahi hota |
| **Depth** | Distance from the root to a particular node | Root se kisi node tak ka distance |
| **Height** | Maximum depth of the tree | Tree ki maximum depth |
| **Subtree** | A smaller part of the tree | Tree ka ek chhota part |
| **Degree** | Number of children a node has | Kisi node ke kitne children hain |
| **Binary Tree** | A tree where each node has at most 2 children | Jisme har node ke max 2 children hote hain |

